OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be cold with a frosty
OL,6,Fstart for many. Dry with sunny spells
OL,7,Fthrough the morning, turning hazier
OL,8,Fwith higher cloud feeding from south
OL,9,Ffor afternoon. The odd shower in far
OL,10,Fnorth during the morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry through the evening but
OL,13,Fwith strengthening southeast winds.
OL,14,FRain and hill snow will spread north
OL,15,Fthrough the early hours and becoming
OL,16,Fwindy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
