OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FIt will be cloudy throughout
OL,6,Fthe day with outbreaks of rain and
OL,7,Fhill snow, turning heavy at times.
OL,8,FWindy in the morning with strong east
OL,9,Fto southeasterly winds, easing later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FWednesday remains rather cloudy with
OL,13,Fsome patchy rain. Thursday and Friday
OL,14,Fwill be dry and bright but chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
